  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of the maximum and minimum values of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;in the interval <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math> is the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, is ______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mtext>as&#160;</mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mtext>=</mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mtext>-1&#160;where&#160;</mtext><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mo>.</mo></mfenced><mtext>&#160;is&#160;greatest&#160;integer&#160;function</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now critical points of</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Maximum or minimum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;occur at critical points or boundary points.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>As both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;are increasing in nature after&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><msub><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>So sum of minimum and maximum value is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
